# ── Command ──
Command.help: List the commands you can use
Command.id: Everyone's number and name
Command.myrole: Your role and what it does (in game)
Command.roles: List roles / describe one
Command.roles.Usage: [role]
Command.now: Current More Roles Plus settings
Command.sim: Try the role assignment with the current settings (how often each role appears and one example)
Command.sim.Usage: [players] [runs]
Command.rename: Change your name (lobby)
Command.rename.Usage: <name>
Command.color: Change your color (lobby). #RRGGBB for any color, two colors for a gradient (direction 0=horizontal 1=vertical 2,3=diagonal, blur 0=sharp to 100, edge position 0-100)
Command.color.Usage: <number|color name|#RRGGBB [#RRGGBB [direction [blur [edge]]]]|reset>
Command.death: How you (or someone) died (after you die)
Command.death.Usage: [number]
Command.last: Last game's result (roles and causes of death)
Command.spectate: Toggle spectating the next game (lobby)
Command.dump: Save logs to MRP_Logs on the desktop for bug reports (PC)
Command.winner: Last game's winners
Command.lang: Reload the text files (MRP_Language in the game folder; F5+T also works on PC). "open" opens the folder (PC)
Command.lang.Usage: [open]
Command.start: Start the game (skips the countdown if counting)
Command.cancel: Cancel the start countdown (or press Enter again)
Command.end: Abort the game with no winner (Shift+L+Enter)
Command.meet: Call a meeting / close the current one (Shift+M+Enter)
Command.setrole: Change someone's role (yourself if omitted). In the lobby, reserves the role for the next game
Command.setrole.Usage: <role> [number]
Command.kill: Kill someone (yourself if omitted, Shift+E+Enter)
Command.kill.Usage: [number]
Command.revive: Revive someone (yourself if omitted)
Command.revive.Usage: [number]
Command.kick: Kick someone out of the room
Command.kick.Usage: <number>
Command.ban: Ban someone and add them to the ban list
Command.ban.Usage: <number>
Command.banlist: Show the ban list
Command.mods: List the mods each player has installed
Command.unban: Remove someone from the ban list
Command.unban.Usage: <list number|friend code>
Command.cjclear: Forget who played the previous games
Command.say: Show a message to everyone
Command.bot: Add a practice opponent (Samurai or Impostor) that attacks on its own
Command.bot.Usage: [samurai|impostor] [level 1-9] / off
Command.say.Usage: <message>
Command.preset: Save / load settings by name
Command.preset.Usage: [save|load|del <name>]
Command.vip: VIP list: list / add / remove (counts as whitelisted, skipped by chat moderation)
Command.vip.Usage: [add <number> | del <list number>]
Command.whitelist: Whitelist: list / add / remove (turn it on in settings)
Command.whitelist.Usage: [add <number> | del <list number>]
Command.devhelp: List the developer commands
Command.devhelp.Usage: [word]

